====Saving All Timelines====
{{Rewrite}}
{{Quote|Everyone wants to matter. Turns out that you don't need to be [[Marvel Studios|Marvel]] {{WPS|Jesus}} to do it. You just need to open your eyes and look around. And, if you're lucky, you'll find a few friends. Old friends and some [[Logan|new]] [[Resistance|ones]] too. Turns out... I am the world-saving type. Just look around this table if you want proof. The best part? Sometimes the people we save... save us right back.|Deadpool|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
Deadpool and [[Wolverine]] met [[Mr. Paradox]] in the subway station, forcing him to reveal how to stop [[Cassandra Nova]] from using the [[Time Ripper]]. Paradox explained that the Time Ripper was powered by matter and anti-matter feeds converging inside the device, with Nova redirecting them so that it eliminates every timeline. The Ripper would be shut down if one created a circuit between the two feeds, the released energy destroying the machine. Deadpool's assurance that either one of their regenerative healing factors would let them live was debunked when Paradox further explained that whoever formed the circuit would be vaporized in an instant.
[[File:Deadpool & Wolverine Final Trailer (3).png|{{AltFloat}}|Deadpool decides to sacrifice himself]]
Heading towards the room the feeds resided in, Wilson offered his sacrifice, claiming that Wolverine didn't deserve to die. Wolverine, however, insisted as he didn't have a world to get back to, unlike Wilson. Being called the "best" [[Hub:Logan|Wolverine]] and told to say hi to Deadpool's friends for him, Wolverine was pushed out of the door by Deadpool, sacrificing himself for the ones he loved. Breaking the glass protecting one feed, Deadpool grabbed it and desperately attempted to stretch it to reach the other, while Wolverine tried to break through the door. With time running out, Wolverine managed to burst through just before Nova completed her annihilation of the timeline, holding the other feed with his claws while holding tight to Deadpool's hand. The energy surged through their bodies as they were reminded of their loved ones, screaming and twitching their heads until the Time Ripper was destroyed.

Deadpool and Wolverine came out unaffected due to their sharing of the matter and anti-matter between them and the power {{WPS|Madonna}}'s "{{WPS|Like a Prayer}}" brought as [[Ralph]] and another [[TVA]] agent stared in awe at Wolverine's exposed abs. [[B-15]], who had recently arrived at the scene, told her team of [[Minutemen]] to prune Deadpool. However, [[Peter Wisdom]] stopped them once he told them that Deadpool belonged in Earth-10005. B-15 procceeded to arrest Paradox before advising Deadpool and Wolverine to rest before continuing more work due to having successfully saved the timeline. Deadpool asked for multiple favors, such as returning the [[Resistance]] [[:Category:Resistance Members|members]] to their homes and the regeneration of Wolverine's [[Mutant Genocide|universe]]; the former request was granted, but the latter was denied as Wolverine's experiences in his universe made him the man who saved the [[Multiverse]].{{Ref|DW}}

