{{Quote|Keep my [[Canada|country]]'s name out of your fucking mouth! Any my [[Deadpool's Katanas|sword]]. Give me that.|Wade Wilson to Minuteman Leader|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
*'''[[Deadpool's Katanas|Twin Katanas]]''': Wilson carries two katanas made of [[adamantium]] on his back created by the TVA. He used these swords to kill multiple Minutemen and fight against Wolverine. He later used these swords to fight against members of the [[Deadpool Corps]]. 
{{Quote|And all I have to remember [[Nicepool|him]] by are these two gold plated 50 caliber hippie Desert Eagle pistolero's.|Deadpool to [[Wolverine]]|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
