*'''[[Wolverine/Anchor Being Wolverine|Wolverine]]'s Corpse''': In an effort to salvage the anchor being of his universe, that being Wolverine, Wilson exhumed his body from its resting place near the Canadian border only to find it completely skeletonized. Confronted by the [[Time Variance Authority|TVA]]'s [[Minutemen]], he improvised weapons using Wolverine's bones, such as nunchucks, maces, throwing "stars," and gauntlets bearing his claws, using their [[adamantium]] composition to his advantage.

===Other Equipment===
{{Quote|So what made you finally wear an honest to god [[Wolverine Suit|costume]]? [[Deadpool Suit|Mine]]'s red so they can't see me bleed. But I can see how yellow would be useful too.|Wade Wilson to [[Wolverine]]|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
[[File:Deadpool.jpg|thumb|250px|Wilson in his new suit]]
*'''[[Deadpool Suit]]''': Wilson wears a red and black suit when operating as the mercenary Deadpool to hide his disfigured form. Wilson designed the suit to be red so that his enemies wouldn't be able to tell if he was bleeding when he got injured. After being taken from his reality by [[Paradox]], Wade received an upgraded version of his costume with a brighter red and bright black.

===Former Equipment===
{{Quote|Is this because I used {{WPS|Cable (character)#Film|Cable}}'s [[Cable's Time-Travel Device|time machine]]? I brought a couple of people back to life and then I destroyed it.|Wade Wilson to [[Mr. Paradox]]|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
*'''[[Cable's Time-Travel Device]]''': Wade used a time-travel device owned by {{WPS|Cable (character)#Film|Cable}} to reverse the deaths of his now ex-fiancée [[Vanessa Carlysle]], alongside two members of the {{WPS|X-Force#Film|X-Force}}, [[Peter Wisdom]] and [[Shatterstar]]. He later used it to kill a [[Weapon XI|variant]] of himself before that variant could fight against [[Wolverine/Anchor Being Wolverine|Wolverine]] and [[Ryan Reynolds]] before he could sign for {{WPS|Green Lantern (film)|Green Lantern}}. He also used the device to visit the [[Sacred Timeline]] in an attempt to join the [[Avengers]] but was ultimately turned down, leading him into a depressive spiral that led to the device being destroyed.
*'''[[TemPad]]''': Wade used a TemPad that he stole from [[Paradox]] after learning about his plan to speed up his world's destruction, leading him on a mission to find a Wolverine that can become his world's new anchor being. The TemPad was lost after Deadpool was pruned by Mr. Paradox into the Void.

